  "strategy": "Sai, Master Thopterist makes a 1/1 flying Thopter every time you cast an artifact spell, so the deck is mono-blue artifacts that turn into an air force. Sol Ring, Mind Stone, Palladium Myr and Thought Vessel ramp into the bigger pieces, Etherium Sculptor, Foundry Inspector and improvise on Kappa Cannoneer make them cheap, and Shimmer Myr lets them come down at instant speed. Master of Etherium, Steel Overseer and Chief of the Foundry grow the whole board, Myr Battlesphere and Thopter Spy Network add bodies of their own, and Sai can sacrifice two artifacts to draw a card when it needs gas. Counterspell, Negate and Duplicant answer what matters, and Nevinyrral's Disk resets a board the artifacts can rebuild from.",
  "signature": [
    {
      "card_id": "sai_master_thopterist",
      "why": "Every artifact spell is a 1/1 flier, and two artifacts are a card."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "myr_battlesphere",
      "why": "Five bodies in one card, and the Myr fire straight at the defender."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "master_of_etherium",
      "why": "Grows with every artifact and pumps the rest of them."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "steel_hellkite",
      "why": "Combat damage turns into a one-sided wipe at the chosen mana value."
    }
  ],
